### Create Order
POST http://localhost:5080/api/order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-001",
  "customerId": "CUST-123",
  "deliveryAddress": "123 Main St, City, Country",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PROD-001",
      "productName": "Laptop",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 999.99
    },
    {
      "productId": "PROD-002",
      "productName": "Mouse",
      "quantity": 3,
      "unitPrice": 29.99
    }
  ]
}

### Accept Offer
POST http://localhost:5080/api/order/ORD-001/respond
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-001",
  "isAccepted": true,
  "reason": ""
}

### Decline Offer
POST http://localhost:5080/api/order/ORD-002/respond
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "ORD-002",
  "isAccepted": false,
  "reason": "Price too high"
}

### Get Workflow Status
GET http://localhost:5080/api/order/{instanceId}/status

### Terminate Workflow
POST http://localhost:5080/api/order/{instanceId}/terminate
